DECIMAL
0 VARIABLE GS
0 VARIABLE GE
0 VARIABLE GC
0 VARIABLE GF
0 VARIABLE GX
0 VARIABLE GN
: GINIT 0 GS ! 0 GE ! 0 GC !
0 GF ! 0 GX ! 0 GN ! ;
: GSTEP 0 GC ! 0 GF ! 0 GX !
GS @ 4 U< 0= IF 1 GX ! EXIT THEN
GE @ 16 U< 0= IF 2 GX ! EXIT THEN
GS @ GN !
GS @ 0= IF GE @ 1 AND IF
1 GN ! 1 GF ! THEN THEN
GS @ 1 = IF GE @ 4 AND IF 2 GN !
ELSE GE @ 2 AND IF 3 GN ! THEN THEN THEN
GS @ 2 = IF GE @ 8 AND IF 1 GN ! 1 GF !
ELSE GE @ 1 AND IF 0 GN ! THEN THEN THEN
GS @ 3 = IF GE @ 2 AND IF 1 GN ! THEN THEN
GN @ GS @ = 0= IF GN @ GS ! 1 GC ! THEN ;
